  "releaseNotes": "Adds managed Gemma BPE encoding and padded batches, pinned Unicode 15.1 XLM-R processing, complete source mappings, and model freezing. Targets .NET 10 with .NET 11 consumer compatibility. Breaking changes include read-only IVocab dictionaries and Node mappings, plus derived tokenizer template/copy contracts. Requires Google.Protobuf 3.33.5 or later. See CHANGELOG.md for migration details.",
